{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/367","id":4718939067,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTfIvP88AAAABGUVLuw","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/367","diff_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/367.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/367.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/issues/367","number":367,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"11000151: reviewed Artin A5 fixed-generator classification (4/5)","user":{"login":"AlecKriebel","id":6109370,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDkzNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6109370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel","html_url":"https://github.com/AlecKriebel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlecKriebel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Complete convention-qualified result\n\nFor the exact Wajnryb quotient of B6 by c=h, positive words in the five fixed standard generators representing c² have lengths 20, 30, or 40. There are four strict Hurwitz classes (one, one, two), or three classes when simultaneous conjugation is allowed. This is not a classification of arbitrary conjugate factors or arbitrary geometric factorizations.\n\nStatus: claimed_solved, four substantive turns. Full separate AI-assisted source/proof review passed; historical novelty is unverified. Classical maximum-length, chain-injection, Artin-action and positive-monoid results are credited.\n\n## Evidence\n\nAll 34 frozen author files and six frozen review files are unchanged. Exact finite reductions include 810 twenty-letter candidates with ten surviving rotations, and 234,368 reachable / 90,921 coaccessible thirty-letter crossing states with 261,810 exact action-edge comparisons. Python and C++ full replays match; 851 independent reviewer assertions pass. The complete large action stream is regenerable rather than stored.\n\nSee problems/11000151_artin_a5_quotient/PUBLICATION_README.md and review/REVIEW.md. The source equation is recovered from the primary typeset question; the malformed catalog title is retained unchanged in the queue.\n\n## Integration\n\nFresh main is the first parent and frozen author WIP a440a519393bf4c68433c6a8cdd49b384d3bfca6 is the second. Only target artifacts and this problem's QUEUE status/turn cells change. Raw sources and private records are excluded. Draft only; no merge or release. Local mathematical checks are not a claim of CI success.","created_at":"2026-10-02T16:36:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T16:36:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"84f76265fede0f39e45f5dfb58d2f54161124a37","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/367/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/367/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/issues/367/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlecKriebel/Math/statuses/d977c9564f079cde975a7b4261776eb9061c5f5f","head":{"label":"AlecKriebel:math/11000151-artin-a5-quotient-wip","ref":"math/11000151-artin-a5-quotient-wip","sha":"d977c9564f079cde975a7b4261776eb9061c5f5f"